{"parentUuid":"d02a46f5-74f7-42de-bf85-0e920f09a53d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a1a61d0d62fa7dbf3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MBgKuig5JeX8WXU3jZaQyG","type":"tool_result","content":"{'tech': 'Eye tracking as desktop input', 'class': 'E', 'capabilities': ['INP.DEV.eye-tracking'], 'owner': 'input-devices-haptics', 'evidence': 'Tobii Game Integration SDK', 'revisit': 'n/a (established)'}\n{'tech': 'RISC-V targets', 'class': 'S', 'capabilities': [], 'owner': 'platform-architect', 'evidence': 'RVV 1.0 spec; no game hardware', 'revisit': 'A target console/PC ships on RISC-V', 'non_goal': True}\n{'tech': 'Brain-computer input', 'class': 'S', 'capabilities': [], 'owner': 'input-devices-haptics', 'evidence': 'Research only (OpenBCI/Galea)', 'revisit': 'Consumer device with SDK', 'non_goal': True}\n{'tech': 'CXL memory tiers', 'class': 'S', 'capabilities': [], 'owner': 'memory-allocators', 'evidence': 'Server-only hardware', 'revisit': 'Client/console hardware exposes tiered memory', 'non_goal': True}\n{'tech': 'Explicit multi-GPU', 'class': 'S', 'capabilities': [], 'owner': 'gpu-platform-architect', 'evidence': 'Vendor support withdrawn', 'revisit': 'Vendor re-investment', 'non_goal': True}\n{'tech': 'Backend service implementation', 'class': 'E', 'capabilities': [], 'owner': 'engine-architect', 'evidence': 'Scope decision', 'revisit': 'Engine becomes a service platform', 'non_goal': True}\n101:## 7. Technique maturity and the radar\n103:Every capability carries a maturity class: established, emerging, experimental or speculative. `data/radar.json` lists every non-established capability with its owner, evidence, a revisit/promotion trigger and a fallback. Explicit non-goals are also recorded there: backend services, RISC-V, BCI, CXL and explicit multi-GPU. `check.py` fails any non-established capability that is missing from the radar.\n105:Emerging and experimental techniques are reached through optional contracts or extension points. Examples are `C-ML?`/`C-MLGPU?`, `C-RT?`, `C-AIAGENT` and work graphs as an optional part of `C-RG`. None of them is ever a required dependency of an established capability.\n['UI.LOC.strings', 'String tables & stable IDs', 'localization-i18n', 'E']\n['UI.LOC.messageformat', 'Plurals & gender (ICU MessageFormat class)', 'localization-i18n', 'E']\n['UI.LOC.cldr', 'Locale formatting (CLDR)', 'localization-i18n', 'E']\n['UI.LOC.pipeline', 'Localization pipeline & translation-management integration', 'localization-i18n', 'E']\n['UI.LOC.pseudo', 'Pseudo-localization', 'localization-i18n', 'E']\n['UI.LOC.assets', 'Localized asset variants', 'localization-i18n', 'E', ['content-pipeline-architect']]\n['UI.LOC.culturalization', 'Culturalization & regional content variants', 'localization-i18n', 'E', ['certification-compliance']]\n['UI.LOC.language-packs', 'On-demand language & VO packs', 'localization-i18n', 'E', ['packaging-release-patching']]\n['UI.LOC.overflow-validation', 'Text-expansion auto-fit & overflow validation', 'localization-i18n', 'E', ['content-pipeline-architect']]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4e7f09d7-899b-4299-a5e6-5e9d3394813c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:18:28.849Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d02a46f5-74f7-42de-bf85-0e920f09a53d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
