{"parentUuid":"51e10602-3014-433c-8805-ff6749027011","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a1a61d0d62fa7dbf3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FWPKykR94xVAjnboewbHa3","type":"tool_result","content":"info: configuration minimal-client                      66 build skills, 563 capabilities\ninfo: configuration indie-2d-client                     75 build skills, 635 capabilities\ninfo: configuration indie-2d-tools                      83 build skills, 712 capabilities\ninfo: configuration indie-2d-online-moddable-client     78 build skills, 679 capabilities\ninfo: configuration indie-2d-online-moddable-server     53 build skills, 481 capabilities\n0 143\nCounter({'rendering': 26, 'simulation': 18, 'foundation': 17, 'gameplay': 11, 'platform': 10, 'world': 9, 'governance': 8, 'quality': 7, 'tools': 7, 'performance': 6, 'online': 6, 'content': 6, 'ui': 4, 'audio': 4, 'release': 4})\nCounter({'runtime': 109, 'process': 22, 'tool': 12})\n{\n\"minimal-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"minimal\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\",\n\"mobile\",\n\"web\"\n]\n},\n\"indie-2d-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"min2d\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\",\n\"mobile\",\n\"web\"\n]\n},\n\"indie-2d-tools\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"min2d\"\n],\n\"target\": \"tools\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\"\n]\n},\n\"indie-2d-online-moddable-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"min2d\",\n\"online\",\n\"ugc\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\",\n\"mobile\"\n]\n},\n\"indie-2d-online-moddable-server\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"min2d\",\n\"online\",\n\"ugc\"\n],\n\"target\": \"server\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"server-host\"\n]\n},\n\"rts-2d-massim-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"min2d\",\n\"massim\",\n\"online\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\"\n]\n},\n\"lite-3d-mobile-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"lite3d\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"mobile\"\n]\n},\n\"lite-3d-mobile-online-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"lite3d\",\n\"online\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"mobile\"\n]\n},\n\"standard-3d-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"std3d\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\"\n]\n},\n\"standard-3d-tools\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"std3d\"\n],\n\"target\": \"tools\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\"\n]\n},\n\"open-world-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"std3d\",\n\"openworld\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\"\n]\n},\n\"online-3d-client\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"std3d\",\n\"online\"\n],\n\"target\": \"client\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"pc\",\n\"console\"\n]\n},\n\"online-3d-server\": {\n\"profiles\": [\n\"std3d\",\n\"online\"\n],\n\"target\": \"server\",\n\"platforms\": [\n\"server-host\"\n]\n},\n\"online-3d-bot-cl\n22:| Orchestrator | 4 | `engine-architect` (boundaries, profiles, arbitration across workstreams), `architecture-governance` (ADRs, fitness functions, radar, anti-legacy catalogue), `program-orchestration` (agent coordination, milestones, ledger, triage, critic calibration and adjudication), `engine-product-management` (roadmap and game-team intake: the engine as a product). |\n35:**Workstreams** (foundation, platform, content, world, rendering, simulation, audio, online, gameplay, UI, tools, release, quality, performance, governance) group skills for delegated arbitration and staffing. A dispute inside one lead's subtree is settled by that lead. Only cross-workstream disputes reach `engine-architect` (`ARCH.ORG.escalation`).\n79:Organizational scale-down is handled separately. A small effort co-hosts the skills of one workstream in one agent (`ARCH.ORG.staffing`), and the governance weight per organization tier is defined in `ARCH.GOV.process-tiers`.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b1cb5e0b-3ea1-4efa-b80a-3a51dc209fdf","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:19:35.912Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"51e106